Print current work and a condensed command reference to standard output.
Show Scope, the next Ticket, active Items, and the whole Plan. A populated Plan
narrows selection like \fBtk next \-\-plan\fR, intersecting any
\fBTK_SCOPE\fR. With a configured Remote, also show Mutation counts and
Remote commands. No Backend access occurs.
.PP
.B tk prime
exits successfully with no output when the Repository Store cannot be opened,
including outside a git repository, so a global agent hook can run it anywhere.
A read failure after opening exits nonzero with a diagnostic on standard error
and no briefing on standard output.
